Get detailed information about a specific tool by name.

Use this when you already know the tool name and need its full definition (description and input schema). This is more efficient than searching when the tool name is known.

Usage:
- Provide the exact tool name (case-sensitive)
- Returns the tool's full description and parameter schema
- The tool is automatically activated for use in subsequent messages

If the tool is not found, consider using ToolSearch to discover available tools by description.
